 * Description: Meta Pixel 1003655972074979 ("AngelCare website") — base code + PageView on all pages,
 *              Lead on WhatsApp/tel contact clicks (wa.me / api.whatsapp.com / tel:),
 *              CompleteRegistration on assessment-wizard email submit (.acw-emailrow button).
 *              Standard events only — CBO defines conversion events in Meta Events Manager.
